{
  "_about": "Shared by backend/tests/test_templates.py and frontend/tests/form-values.test.ts (#100, #101), so the server's rules (forms.validate_values) and the Log form's instant checks agree. `error` is a fragment of the server's message; the frontend only checks valid vs invalid.",
